WEBVTT

00:05.080 --> 00:06.290
<b>I love him!</b>

00:08.380 --> 00:12.380
<b>I'm in love with Senpai.</b>

00:14.000 --> 00:18.960
<b>2.5-Dimensional Ririsa</b>

00:22.580 --> 00:29.130
<b>I've been in love with him since the day we met,
for the past ten years.</b>

00:31.170 --> 00:33.830
<b>You're in love with...</b>

00:35.830 --> 00:38.330
<b>Oh, wow, okay!</b>

00:38.330 --> 00:40.710
<b>Yeah, I assumed you hadn't noticed.</b>

00:44.170 --> 00:49.710
<b>And I've been spending so much time with Senpai...</b>

00:49.710 --> 00:51.960
<b>When I should've known...</b>

00:54.040 --> 00:57.540
<b>This is the worst thing I could've done.</b>

00:58.170 --> 01:00.580
<b>Why did I tell her?</b>

01:00.580 --> 01:04.920
<b>I knew if I told her the truth,
she'd change the way she acts.</b>

01:05.460 --> 01:07.420
<b>And if that happens,</b>

01:07.420 --> 01:12.130
<b>there's no way I'll ever make
things work with Senpai.</b>

01:12.880 --> 01:15.210
<b>I've ruined everything.</b>

01:16.000 --> 01:20.380
<b>I get to go to Summer Comiket
with friends in a group cosplay!</b>

01:20.960 --> 01:23.500
<b>I'm so sorry. I'll stop spending so much-</b>

01:23.500 --> 01:24.250
<b>Stop!</b>

01:25.580 --> 01:26.670
<b>Please.</b>

01:26.670 --> 01:30.210
<b>Just pretend I didn't say anything.
I don't like him.</b>

01:31.580 --> 01:34.040
<b>I made it all up, okay?!</b>

01:41.580 --> 01:42.500
<b>No!</b>

01:46.210 --> 01:52.290
<b>Senpai taught me that real otaku never
judge someone by the things they love.</b>

01:52.290 --> 01:57.130
<b>Pretend I didn't say anything.
Just tell me more about how you feel.</b>

01:58.000 --> 01:59.630
<b>And why should I tell you?!</b>

01:59.630 --> 02:01.960
<b>Because I want to know more about you!
About why you love him.</b>

02:06.130 --> 02:08.710
<b>I guess I like how the shape of
his eyes makes him look mean.</b>

02:09.710 --> 02:14.170
<b>I like that he's tall,
but I liked him when he was short, too.</b>

02:14.170 --> 02:16.380
<b>I like how round the back of his head is.</b>

02:16.380 --> 02:18.630
<b>I like how he looks straight into your eyes.</b>

02:19.040 --> 02:22.210
<b>How he'll risk everything to help someone else.</b>

02:24.040 --> 02:29.040
<b>Senpai will give his whole heart to others,</b>

02:29.040 --> 02:32.080
<b>but he'll never notice when
other people do the same for him.</b>

02:32.080 --> 02:34.540
<b>It's like he's intentionally blocking it out.</b>

02:35.460 --> 02:40.080
<b>He's stuck where he was when he
stopped trusting women as a kid.</b>

02:41.080 --> 02:43.290
<b>He was the same way when I met him.</b>

02:44.250 --> 02:45.210
<b>What?!</b>

02:45.210 --> 02:48.630
<b>You sure do know a lot about him, Mikari-chan.</b>

02:49.040 --> 02:52.000
<b>Well, yeah, I've been watching him for ten years.</b>

02:52.000 --> 02:53.830
<b>Because you love him a whole lot!</b>

02:53.830 --> 02:56.630
<b>I wasn't doing it because I loved him.</b>

02:58.170 --> 03:00.330
<b>I was looking for reasons to hate him,</b>

03:00.960 --> 03:03.880
<b>so I could finally forget him.</b>

03:03.880 --> 03:06.830
<b>Loving him hurts, you know?</b>

03:07.330 --> 03:09.330
<b>I wanted to deny it.</b>

03:09.330 --> 03:13.540
<b>A few good memories shouldn't
make up for how crappy he is.</b>

03:14.420 --> 03:17.500
<b>I wanted to forget him so badly that</b>

03:17.500 --> 03:20.250
<b>I started making a whole
list of reasons to hate him.</b>

03:21.080 --> 03:23.000
<b>But that list came up empty?</b>

03:23.290 --> 03:25.750
<b>Please. Just the opposite.</b>

03:26.630 --> 03:29.580
<b>I came up with tons of reasons.
My list was so long.</b>

03:29.580 --> 03:33.420
<b>He's a weirdo otaku, totally emotionally stunted...</b>

03:33.630 --> 03:38.750
<b>Even when I thought I'd found them all,
he still gave me reasons to hate him!</b>

03:40.750 --> 03:45.250
<b>But, even knowing all that,
I still couldn't stop loving him.</b>

03:46.920 --> 03:48.790
<b>I couldn't even deny it.</b>

03:50.080 --> 03:51.630
<b>Heartbreaking, isn't it?</b>

03:52.460 --> 03:55.880
<b>Loving someone can break your heart?</b>

03:58.790 --> 04:00.330
<b>Your turn now.</b>

04:02.080 --> 04:05.500
<b>I asked you this before. How do you feel?</b>

04:07.330 --> 04:09.630
<b>I love Senpai.</b>

04:09.630 --> 04:10.750
<b>Didn't even hesitate.</b>

04:11.080 --> 04:16.040
<b>I don't know if it's the same way you feel, but...</b>

04:16.580 --> 04:18.420
<b>But, I understand why you like him so much!</b>

04:19.750 --> 04:21.130
<b>He's so great!</b>

04:21.130 --> 04:25.210
<b>I love his mean eyes,
his height, the back of his head, too!</b>

04:25.210 --> 04:27.500
<b>I wanna gush about all the things
I like about him, too!</b>

04:28.080 --> 04:29.380
<b>You're so weird.</b>

04:29.380 --> 04:32.250
<b>He's not some manga
character you can fangirl over.</b>

04:32.250 --> 04:34.170
<b>I don't see the difference!</b>

04:35.250 --> 04:42.880
<b>Person or manga character, animals,
trains, whatever, the love is all the same.</b>

04:43.420 --> 04:44.540
<b>If it wasn't,</b>

04:44.540 --> 04:49.210
<b>then Senpai's love for Liliel wouldn't be real,
when I know it is.</b>

04:50.920 --> 04:53.040
<b>Senpai is a good person.</b>

04:54.210 --> 04:56.000
<b>I'll be there for you!</b>

04:56.000 --> 04:58.460
<b>I'll be right there, rooting for you!</b>

04:58.830 --> 05:03.130
<b>Senpai came into my life and made it better.</b>

05:05.670 --> 05:07.630
<b>I'm a cosplayer.</b>

05:07.920 --> 05:12.380
<b>My life as a cosplayer doesn't
exist without Senpai.</b>

05:12.920 --> 05:16.500
<b>I wouldn't exist without him.</b>

05:17.710 --> 05:22.210
<b>That's how much he means to me.</b>

05:23.460 --> 05:31.080
<b>I don't know if that means I'm in love with him,
but I know that I love him.</b>

05:32.380 --> 05:34.210
<b>So, uh, what do you think?!</b>

05:45.080 --> 05:48.130
<b>You sure do love him a lot.</b>

05:49.080 --> 05:53.080
<b>Weirdly, I'm happy to hear that.</b>

05:56.330 --> 05:59.000
<b>We're Senpai otaku!</b>

05:59.630 --> 06:01.380
<b>Don't go there.</b>

06:02.130 --> 06:04.710
<b>We've gotta gush more about him together!</b>

06:04.710 --> 06:05.420
<b>Huh?!</b>

06:08.170 --> 06:12.670
<b>Apparently, I never wanted to get rid of my rivals.</b>

06:13.290 --> 06:18.250
<b>I just wanted a friend
I could open up to about my feelings.</b>

06:19.460 --> 06:21.040
<b>And Ririsa...</b>

06:27.080 --> 06:29.130
<b>...is my friend.</b>

06:32.750 --> 06:33.790
<b>Ririsa.</b>

06:35.040 --> 06:41.540
<b>If you ever decide you want to date Senpai,
don't worry about me.</b>

06:42.080 --> 06:43.670
<b>What, but...</b>

06:47.750 --> 06:49.750
<b>Okay. Sure.</b>

06:51.580 --> 06:52.790
<b>Thanks.</b>

06:59.830 --> 07:03.460
<b>Mikari is in love with me?</b>

07:03.790 --> 07:06.000
<b>How the hell did I not notice?!</b>

07:06.460 --> 07:07.670
<b>It's...</b>

07:09.710 --> 07:12.670
<b>It's gotta be different from how Ririsa feels.</b>

07:13.000 --> 07:15.130
<b>She loves me like I love Liliel,</b>

07:15.130 --> 07:17.670
<b>like I used to like other girls...</b>

07:18.080 --> 07:19.500
<b>Like...</b>

07:22.040 --> 07:24.960
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

07:27.130 --> 07:30.000
<b>I have no idea how this is gonna go from here...</b>

07:30.000 --> 07:32.130
<b>But what if she asks me out?</b>

07:33.000 --> 07:35.420
<b>What if she asks me to be her boyfriend?</b>

07:36.460 --> 07:40.080
<b>I'd have to say no, because I don't...</b>

07:40.830 --> 07:43.130
<b>I don't like her like that.</b>

07:44.080 --> 07:45.540
<b>This is horrible.</b>

07:45.540 --> 07:48.830
<b>Why would I have to do
something that horrible to her?</b>

07:49.330 --> 07:54.170
<b>I could ask to stay friends,
but how would that work?</b>

07:54.750 --> 07:57.790
<b>Wouldn't it be awkward?</b>

07:57.790 --> 08:00.880
<b>Mikari might stop coming to club.</b>

08:00.880 --> 08:04.290
<b>Maybe I should just quit, then?</b>

08:04.290 --> 08:06.880
<b>But, that wouldn't make anyone happy!</b>

08:11.750 --> 08:13.000
<b>What should I...</b>

08:20.710 --> 08:23.670
<b>ALSO HEARD</b>

08:22.250 --> 08:23.420
<b>Sensei?</b>

08:25.210 --> 08:27.580
<b>W-wanna talk about this?</b>

08:32.540 --> 08:34.710
<b>What should I even do?</b>

08:34.960 --> 08:37.540
<b>Dunno if I can tell you.</b>

08:37.540 --> 08:42.540
<b>It depends on how Mikari feels,
what she does, and how you feel.</b>

08:43.080 --> 08:44.710
<b>What are you scared of?</b>

08:44.710 --> 08:47.830
<b>The fact that you'll have to reject
her if she asks you out?</b>

08:47.830 --> 08:51.670
<b>Or the fact that doing that would ruin
your relationship with Mikari and the club?</b>

08:52.250 --> 08:55.210
<b>It could be both.</b>

08:56.170 --> 08:59.080
<b>Honestly, I dunno.</b>

08:59.500 --> 09:02.580
<b>I never imagined what I'd do in this kind of situation.</b>

09:03.380 --> 09:05.540
<b>What would you do, Sensei?</b>

09:07.540 --> 09:08.750
<b>Sensei...</b>

09:10.290 --> 09:12.170
<b>Have you ever been in love?</b>

09:12.170 --> 09:13.790
<b>Is that what you think of me?!</b>

09:16.130 --> 09:19.330
<b>I never had a love life, being a huge otaku.</b>

09:19.710 --> 09:22.040
<b>But, I thought about it a whole lot.</b>

09:23.290 --> 09:31.210
<b>Before, I thought it was stupid to go on dates,
or to keep asking someone out.</b>

09:31.540 --> 09:41.960
<b>Wow, we keep seeing each other!</b>

09:31.540 --> 09:41.960
<b>This must be destiny!</b>

09:31.540 --> 09:33.880
<b>Like, I thought life was like a dating sim,</b>

09:33.880 --> 09:36.710
<b>where the more you talk to someone,</b>

09:36.710 --> 09:39.080
<b>the more you level up their relationship,</b>

09:39.080 --> 09:41.960
<b>until asking them out finally works.</b>

09:42.130 --> 09:43.380
<b>And if that didn't work,</b>

09:43.380 --> 09:48.420
<b>then they were never an option in the first place.</b>

09:43.380 --> 09:44.460
<b>Onii-chan!</b>

09:43.790 --> 09:48.420
<b>little sister</b>

09:45.250 --> 09:48.420
<b>older woman</b>

09:45.630 --> 09:48.420
<b>NOT AN OPTION</b>

09:48.750 --> 09:54.130
<b>I mean, in manga and anime,
all the couples are already in love with each other,</b>

09:54.130 --> 09:59.380
<b>and the big confession scene is like a magic
spell that makes them realize it's mutual.</b>

10:00.170 --> 10:01.170
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:01.380 --> 10:03.040
<b>The problem, though,</b>

10:03.040 --> 10:07.080
<b>is it convinces you it's not worth dating
someone unless they're "The One."</b>

10:09.170 --> 10:11.250
<b>But, that's not how it works in real life.</b>

10:11.710 --> 10:16.750
<b>Some people start dating someone even though
they might not feel anything towards them.</b>

10:16.750 --> 10:21.920
<b>Some people think, "if you're gonna keep asking me out,
I might as well give you a chance."</b>

10:23.330 --> 10:26.580
<b>Sorry, let me figure out what I'm trying to say.</b>

10:26.580 --> 10:30.670
<b>It's okay to start dating someone even if
you don't like them that way just yet.</b>

10:32.330 --> 10:36.250
<b>Getting asked out might be the first time
you realize someone likes you that way.</b>

10:36.250 --> 10:39.290
<b>That's when you ask yourself how you feel about them.</b>

10:39.750 --> 10:44.750
<b>Like wow, I can be myself around them,
or I'm always stealing glances at them.</b>

10:45.040 --> 10:46.750
<b>I miss them when they're gone.</b>

10:46.750 --> 10:50.540
<b>Maybe that means I like them?</b>

10:50.790 --> 10:55.830
<b>You might start finding new things about
them that make you start to feel differently.</b>

10:56.290 --> 10:57.880
<b>Love is complicated.</b>

10:57.880 --> 11:02.500
<b>You might find "The One."
You might suddenly realize you're in love.</b>

11:03.210 --> 11:05.420
<b>Or, you might start falling for
someone after you start dating.</b>

11:05.960 --> 11:10.290
<b>Actively searching for reasons to fall
in love someone is totally valid, too.</b>

11:11.080 --> 11:13.080
<b>Sorry if that didn't make any sense.</b>

11:13.080 --> 11:15.210
<b>Do you at least see my point?</b>

11:18.330 --> 11:21.170
<b>I don't have to end my friendship with Mikari</b>

11:21.170 --> 11:23.960
<b>just because I don't
like her that way right now.</b>

11:24.500 --> 11:26.880
<b>Now that I know how she feels,</b>

11:26.880 --> 11:30.500
<b>I might see her differently,
and start feeling differently, too.</b>

11:30.500 --> 11:32.380
<b>Damn, A+ for listening comprehension.</b>

11:34.420 --> 11:35.920
<b>I don't know if I will.</b>

11:37.080 --> 11:40.880
<b>I haven't felt that way about
a girl for a really long time.</b>

11:42.000 --> 11:44.960
<b>I might not know why you
don't feel anything for real girls,</b>

11:45.830 --> 11:48.920
<b>or what might've happened in
your past to make you feel that way.</b>

11:49.540 --> 11:52.420
<b>But, I know you've had a lot
of new experiences this year.</b>

11:52.830 --> 11:57.710
<b>And you've spent a lot of them with
the girls you've always wanted to avoid.</b>

11:58.250 --> 12:00.710
<b>How do you feel about the 3D world now?</b>

12:05.380 --> 12:10.380
<b>I know there are parts of reality that really suck,</b>

12:10.380 --> 12:13.130
<b>but there are some parts worth living for.</b>

12:13.580 --> 12:16.630
<b>I can't tell you which parts those are, though.</b>

12:17.080 --> 12:19.380
<b>So, is it still impossible for you to trust women?</b>

12:19.830 --> 12:20.920
<b>I...</b>

12:21.920 --> 12:23.130
<b>Okumura.</b>

12:24.000 --> 12:27.000
<b>You're good at creating close
relationships with other people.</b>

12:27.000 --> 12:30.080
<b>You're not afraid to risk everything
to help someone you care about.</b>

12:30.080 --> 12:31.830
<b>But it's okay to let people help you, too.</b>

12:32.420 --> 12:35.130
<b>Don't be afraid to let people in.</b>

12:35.710 --> 12:38.000
<b>Relationships are a two-way street.</b>

12:38.790 --> 12:41.670
<b>It takes two people to make something meaningful.</b>

12:44.250 --> 12:45.460
<b>That make sense?</b>

12:45.960 --> 12:49.290
<b>It takes two...</b>

12:49.960 --> 12:54.250
<b>In my opinion,
there's one thing you get wrong about Liliel.</b>

12:54.250 --> 12:55.080
<b>Huh?</b>

12:57.750 --> 12:59.750
<b>Ashford-sama!</b>

13:00.290 --> 13:03.170
<b>Liliel isn't loyal because she's an angel.</b>

13:04.040 --> 13:07.040
<b>She's loyal because she wants to be, for Ashford.</b>

13:08.540 --> 13:13.670
<b>Believe it or not,
someone could feel that way about you, Okumura.</b>

13:15.000 --> 13:16.170
<b>Really?</b>

13:16.750 --> 13:19.130
<b>Someone would feel that way about me?</b>

13:19.420 --> 13:21.500
<b>The same way Liliel feels about Ashford?</b>

13:23.540 --> 13:24.670
<b>Wow.</b>

13:25.540 --> 13:28.580
<b>So that's why I never caught onto Mikari's feelings.</b>

13:29.670 --> 13:33.420
<b>Because I never saw myself as a character in my world.</b>

13:33.880 --> 13:37.540
<b>I only see everyone else.</b>

13:37.540 --> 13:42.830
<b>I've never asked myself
what they might think about me.</b>

13:43.170 --> 13:43.880
<b>I love you.</b>

13:47.040 --> 13:50.130
<b>Mom... Was that a lie?</b>

13:50.420 --> 13:52.960
<b>I didn't want to feel betrayed again.</b>

13:53.790 --> 14:01.290
<b>I was so terrified of going through that again,
I ignored all the signs that people cared about me.</b>

14:01.960 --> 14:05.290
<b>When in reality, I... I've been...</b>

14:07.790 --> 14:09.250
<b>Let me ask again.</b>

14:10.330 --> 14:13.210
<b>Is it still impossible for you to trust women?</b>

14:14.670 --> 14:15.710
<b>No.</b>

14:17.460 --> 14:20.880
<b>It's okay if you still only trust your 2D Liliel.</b>

14:21.500 --> 14:24.460
<b>But, there's a difference between
not seeing and choosing not to see.</b>

14:25.170 --> 14:27.670
<b>You can open your eyes, Okumura.</b>

14:30.000 --> 14:34.080
<b>Angels exist in the 3D world, too.</b>

14:38.000 --> 14:38.920
<b>Okay.</b>

14:43.210 --> 14:45.460
<b>Feel a little better after that?</b>

14:45.750 --> 14:48.210
<b>Yeah, thank you.</b>

14:48.210 --> 14:52.630
<b>But, I still don't know what I'll do about Mikari.</b>

14:52.630 --> 14:56.630
<b>Yeah, that's okay.
What now? Want to just leave?</b>

14:56.630 --> 14:59.250
<b>No way! We have to finish our training arc!</b>

15:01.080 --> 15:06.290
<b>Right! I finally understand why
I liked those moments so much.</b>

15:06.920 --> 15:12.040
<b>I've only ever seen them as
subjects through the camera.</b>

15:12.420 --> 15:16.080
<b>I've never thought about how
they might be looking at me.</b>

15:17.000 --> 15:19.460
<b>That's why I couldn't figure it out.</b>

15:20.670 --> 15:26.500
<b>They smiled or frowned
because they were looking at me.</b>

15:26.830 --> 15:28.920
<b>It was all because of me.</b>

15:29.540 --> 15:33.080
<b>That's why I'm the only person
who can get those photos!</b>

15:34.040 --> 15:36.500
<b>Looks like you made a breakthrough.</b>

15:36.500 --> 15:39.460
<b>I think I can bust down that mental wall now.</b>

15:40.460 --> 15:42.130
<b>I have to open my eyes.</b>

15:42.130 --> 15:47.460
<b>I don't want to reject Mikari without
seeing her for who she really is.</b>

15:48.420 --> 15:51.670
<b>I can do that if I break down that wall.</b>

15:52.250 --> 15:54.290
<b>I'm not just doing this for Ririsa's dream.</b>

15:54.580 --> 15:57.920
<b>I'm doing this for Mikari, and myself.</b>

15:58.880 --> 16:03.210
<b>I'm not leaving until I see this through to the end!</b>

16:04.830 --> 16:08.920
<b>Hey, girls, Okumura's up!
Let's get back to work!</b>

16:08.920 --> 16:10.170
<b>Whoa, what's up?</b>

16:10.170 --> 16:13.130
<b>Mikarin won't come out from under her blanket.</b>

16:15.500 --> 16:16.880
<b>Mikari-chan...</b>

16:16.880 --> 16:19.750
<b>Crying ruined my makeup
and made my eyes all puffy!</b>

16:19.750 --> 16:22.420
<b>I can't let him see me like this!</b>

16:22.420 --> 16:23.290
<b>I know, but...</b>

16:23.290 --> 16:25.710
<b>Forget about me and go finish the shoot!</b>

16:25.960 --> 16:30.920
<b>I don't wanna get in the way of you and Senpai
making your lovey-dovey cosrom, okay?</b>

16:32.040 --> 16:33.000
<b>Okay.</b>

16:34.630 --> 16:36.040
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

16:37.170 --> 16:38.210
<b>How's Mikari?</b>

16:38.210 --> 16:39.420
<b>Uh...</b>

16:42.210 --> 16:43.080
<b>Mikari!</b>

16:43.630 --> 16:46.000
<b>Senpai?! W-what is it?</b>

16:46.830 --> 16:49.750
<b>I hope I get to take pictures of you again soon!</b>

17:00.710 --> 17:01.580
<b>Ririsa.</b>

17:01.580 --> 17:02.290
<b>Yes?</b>

17:02.540 --> 17:04.500
<b>I want to try something new.</b>

17:05.170 --> 17:09.960
<b>I realized it's not the camera
settings that make a good photo,</b>

17:09.960 --> 17:13.540
<b>it's the timing of when I take it.</b>

17:14.290 --> 17:19.830
<b>I always try to pick the moment where
I feel you look just like the real Liliel.</b>

17:20.290 --> 17:23.250
<b>But, then I thought how your Liliel was</b>

17:23.250 --> 17:26.250
<b>different from Xiaoyu's,
not in a bad way, just different.</b>

17:26.710 --> 17:30.170
<b>You're the 3D person that brings the 2D Liliel to life.</b>

17:30.750 --> 17:34.290
<b>I need you to see our 2.5D angel.</b>

17:34.750 --> 17:37.830
<b>So now, I want to try to capture your specific Liliel.</b>

17:37.830 --> 17:39.920
<b>That's my plan for today.</b>

17:40.830 --> 17:42.670
<b>My specific Liliel...</b>

17:45.460 --> 17:48.880
<b>I was just thinking the same thing!</b>

17:49.790 --> 17:52.460
<b>No matter how badly I might want
to transform into Liliel,</b>

17:52.460 --> 17:55.540
<b>I can't erase myself completely.</b>

17:55.880 --> 18:00.710
<b>I thought the perfect cosplay was one where
you couldn't see the cosplayer beneath it,</b>

18:00.710 --> 18:02.710
<b>but now, it's time to try something different.</b>

18:03.210 --> 18:06.250
<b>I want to exist in the same space as Liliel.</b>

18:08.880 --> 18:11.420
<b>Could we sit this one out and just watch?</b>

18:11.420 --> 18:12.130
<b>Huh?!</b>

18:12.130 --> 18:14.880
<b>This is way too advanced for me.</b>

18:14.880 --> 18:18.500
<b>The whole reason we're here is
to help with your cosrom.</b>

18:18.500 --> 18:21.170
<b>It's easier to do solo pics, too.</b>

18:21.170 --> 18:25.130
<b>Plus, I want to see how they come out!</b>

18:25.130 --> 18:27.500
<b>Yeah! Just focus on Liliel!</b>

18:32.880 --> 18:34.250
<b>Ready, Liliel?!</b>

18:35.290 --> 18:36.630
<b>I'm ready!</b>

18:37.250 --> 18:41.710
<b>Open your eyes! Do this for Mikari! For Ririsa!</b>

18:42.330 --> 18:45.290
<b>For everyone who cares about me!</b>

18:48.130 --> 18:52.290
<b>I'm not recreating the source.
I'm creating my own Liliel.</b>

18:52.710 --> 18:55.170
<b>What aspects do we both share?</b>

18:56.250 --> 18:59.250
<b>How does she feel? How do I feel?</b>

18:59.710 --> 19:02.290
<b>Ashford-sama, I love you!</b>

19:04.920 --> 19:08.670
<b>I can't! I have to keep these feelings to myself!</b>

19:09.040 --> 19:13.580
<b>Senpai promised he wouldn't fall for
me so we could be cosplay partners.</b>

19:13.580 --> 19:16.750
<b>It wouldn't be fair for me to fall for him.</b>

19:17.380 --> 19:20.330
<b>I don't know if it's the same way you feel, but...</b>

19:20.750 --> 19:21.630
<b>That was a lie.</b>

19:21.630 --> 19:24.960
<b>I thought I was telling Mikari-chan the truth.</b>

19:24.960 --> 19:28.920
<b>Maybe I don't like him as just a friend.</b>

19:28.920 --> 19:30.790
<b>But I lied to myself.</b>

19:31.130 --> 19:33.630
<b>I already know how I feel.</b>

19:34.540 --> 19:36.210
<b>It's more than that.</b>

19:37.040 --> 19:38.040
<b>Liliel...</b>

19:39.290 --> 19:44.460
<b>Senpai will never feel anything for me.</b>

19:39.290 --> 19:42.000
<b>Wear all the sexy outfits you want,</b>

19:42.000 --> 19:44.460
<b>I guarantee you I won't feel a thing for you!</b>

19:44.960 --> 19:49.330
<b>I'll never have him. That's why this is okay.</b>

19:50.250 --> 19:52.540
<b>That's why, right now,</b>

19:52.540 --> 19:55.080
<b>I can let out some of the feelings
I've been holding back for so long.</b>

20:00.210 --> 20:03.380
<b>Ashford-sama, I love you!</b>

20:04.920 --> 20:06.130
<b>Not yet...</b>

20:06.130 --> 20:08.540
<b>I need to see the Ririsa inside Liliel!</b>

20:11.920 --> 20:14.960
<b>Senpai, I love you.</b>

20:23.580 --> 20:26.710
<b>Man, I can't believe summer break's almost over.</b>

20:27.000 --> 20:30.130
<b>Let's all take a picture together!
Can I post this one online?</b>

20:28.500 --> 20:32.330
<b>feeling better</b>

20:30.130 --> 20:32.420
<b>No thanks.
I'm scared of your side of social media.</b>

20:32.420 --> 20:33.630
<b>My contract says I can't.</b>

20:33.630 --> 20:35.420
<b>Not if we're not cosplaying...</b>

20:35.420 --> 20:37.250
<b>You sure you guys are teenagers?</b>

20:37.250 --> 20:38.290
<b>I don't mind.</b>

20:38.290 --> 20:40.630
<b>Yay! Lemme get one with you!</b>

20:43.420 --> 20:46.040
<b>Never mind. People might think we're dating.</b>

20:46.040 --> 20:46.880
<b>Really?</b>

20:48.000 --> 20:50.000
<b>I want a picture with you, Senpai!</b>

20:50.000 --> 20:52.040
<b>Wait, I thought you just said you can't!</b>

20:53.420 --> 20:57.080
<b>Oh, right. She wants to take a picture with me.</b>

20:58.330 --> 20:59.710
<b>That's kinda cute.</b>

20:59.710 --> 21:03.000
<b>Wait, what did I just think?</b>

21:03.670 --> 21:06.210
<b>How'd your training arc turn out?</b>

21:07.330 --> 21:12.710
<b>I think I know what you mean now
about relationships being a two-way street.</b>

21:13.290 --> 21:17.420
<b>I lived my whole life assuming no
one had cared about me at all.</b>

21:17.750 --> 21:23.630
<b>But, now I know people do care.
They have thoughts and opinions about me.</b>

21:24.170 --> 21:27.130
<b>So of course they have feelings about me, too.</b>

21:29.710 --> 21:31.830
<b>It's the first time I've ever realized...</b>

21:32.830 --> 21:36.830
<b>I actually exist as something in other people's lives.</b>

21:37.670 --> 21:38.380
<b>HMM?</b>

21:38.710 --> 21:39.790
<b>That's it?</b>

21:39.790 --> 21:43.290
<b>I mean, I guess going from nothing to
something is progress, but still...</b>

21:43.580 --> 21:46.040
<b>When's he gonna realize that he means</b>

21:43.580 --> 21:46.040
<b>Are you done staring at those pictures yet?</b>

21:46.040 --> 21:48.420
<b>everything to some of the people around him?</b>

21:46.040 --> 21:48.420
<b>Ack, sorry! Here!</b>

21:55.040 --> 21:55.960
<b>Y'know...</b>

22:00.170 --> 22:02.630
<b>That's a pretty good picture.</b>

22:23.040 --> 22:26.210
<b>Noa! You're going to be late for school!</b>

22:31.130 --> 22:32.710
<b>Eating in the clubroom today!</b>

22:31.130 --> 22:32.710
<b>Managed to snag these before they were gone!!</b>

22:33.960 --> 22:34.460
<b>Can't wait to be there with you</b>

22:34.460 --> 22:35.210
<b>Feels like that's my actual school</b>

22:35.210 --> 22:36.880
<b>What's that mean?</b>

22:45.250 --> 22:46.540
<b>Nono-pi!</b>

22:47.540 --> 22:48.880
<b>Let's walk together!</b>

22:55.080 --> 22:58.580
<b>Hey, girls! Always love your energy. Have fun!</b>

22:58.580 --> 22:59.710
<b>We will!</b>

23:04.250 --> 23:05.130
<b>MOM</b>

23:04.250 --> 23:05.130
<b>same as always</b>

23:04.250 --> 23:05.130
<b>What's for dinner?</b>

23:04.250 --> 23:05.130
<b>Sorry, I'm going out</b>

23:04.250 --> 23:05.130
<b>with Dad tonight!</b>

23:05.130 --> 23:06.170
<b>Have funnn</b>

23:06.290 --> 23:08.540
<b>Nono-pi, we should all go out to dinner tonight!</b>

23:08.540 --> 23:09.330
<b>I'm in!</b>

23:09.330 --> 23:11.330
<b>Aria-chan, Nonoa-chan!</b>

23:12.330 --> 23:13.750
<b>Detention again?</b>

23:15.500 --> 23:17.630
<b>Sorry for the delay, Senpai!</b>

23:17.630 --> 23:18.790
<b>There you are.</b>

23:18.790 --> 23:21.170
<b>Ooh, is it ready?!</b>

23:21.170 --> 23:21.790
<b>What's ready?</b>

23:22.040 --> 23:25.080
<b>Liliel: Side Story, Okumura's Cut!</b>

23:25.710 --> 23:27.210
<b>You made this?</b>

23:27.210 --> 23:30.790
<b>Sure did! Figured it'd inspire your next project.</b>

23:31.250 --> 23:33.130
<b>I can't wait to watch it!</b>

23:39.880 --> 23:40.710
<b>Here it comes!</b>

23:46.750 --> 23:48.460
<b>Wait, I'm doing this, too?</b>

23:50.540 --> 23:51.880
<b>Ready, go!</b>

23:52.080 --> 23:57.460
<b>Liliel!</b>

23:57.580 --> 24:01.000
<b>SEASON TWO CONFIRMED!!</b>
